flowchart TD
    Press[Focused E through unhandled input] --> Guard[Current rear mode captured pointer no modal or blueprint]
    Guard --> Queue[Snapshot world model Receiving construction and camera]
    Queue --> Physics[Consume in physics after geometry synchronization]
    Physics --> Camera[Current camera ray and SpringArm-owned pose]
    Camera --> Hit[Actual first collision on mask5]
    Hit --> Table[Exact current Supply Table body]
    Hit --> Site[Resolve ancestor site_id in current collision root]
    Site --> Current[Lookup actual current construction row]
    Current --> Production[Complete production activity opens Work]
    Current --> Building[Unfinished site opens existing Build panel]
    Building --> Confirm[Explicit Set builders changes actual site target]
    Table --> Purchase[Existing purchase draft]
    Camera -.-> Probe[Single-shot observer checks actual pose projection hit and input state]
